{"id": "141288", "name": "ערכים עצמיים ולכסינות - טענות כלליות - 19", "qtype": "truefalse", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 1, "options": {}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div>\n<p>תהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\in M_{n\\times n}(\\mathbb{R})\\)</span> מטריצה. אזי:</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\">\n<p>אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> לכסינה ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^k=I\\)</span> לאיזשהו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(k\\)</span> טבעי, אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A=I\\)</span>.</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"native-answer\">[[input:ans]]</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> דוגמה נגדית: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A=-I\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — דוגמה נגדית</b><br>ניקח את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A=-I=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&0\\\\0&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\)</span>. היא אלכסונית ולכן לכסינה, ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^2=(-1)^2I=I\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — מסקנה</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\ne I\\)</span>, אף ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> לכסינה ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^2=I\\)</span>. התנאי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A^k=I\\)</span> אומר רק שכל ערך עצמי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(d\\)</span> מקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(d^k=1\\)</span>, ולא ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(d=1\\)</span>.<p style=\"text-align:center\"><b>הטענה אינה נכונה.</b></p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "radio", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "native": {"shuffle": false, "numbering": "none", "instruction": "one", "lang": "he"}}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "native": true, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": []}], "qvnames": [], "nvariants": 1}